# <<.ProjectName>>

<<if .WithFrontend>>A fullstack Go service: JSON API plus server-rendered pages driven by HTMX.<<else>>A JSON API service in Go.<<end>>
Scaffolded by [gostack](https://github.com/gos0001/gostack) — vertical slices, one
package per use case, wire for dependency injection<<if .WithPostgres>>, sqlc for Postgres<<end>>.

## Quick start

```bash
make tools            # air, wire<<if .WithPostgres>>, sqlc, migrate<<end>>, golangci-lint
<<if .WithDocker>>make docker-up        # start <<if .WithPostgres>>postgres<<end>><<if .WithRedis>> redis<<end>>
<<end>><<if .WithPostgres>>make migrate-up       # apply migrations
<<end>>make generate         # <<if .WithPostgres>>sqlc, then <<end>>wire
make dev              # http://localhost:8080
```

Configuration comes from `.env.development` via envconfig, per package.

